OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHuge crowds turn out in support of
OL,4,Aresidents over Drumcree parade dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to thousands at an event on
OL,7,Fthe Garvaghy Road, First Minister and
OL,8,FSinn Fein vice president Michelle
OL,9,FO'Neill said she heard the Northern
OL,10,FIreland Secretary Sir Chris Bryant
OL,11,F"talk about being between a rock and a
OL,12,Fhard place", adding she has "never
OL,13,Fheard such nonsense, this is between
OL,14,Fright and wrong".
OL,16,FSpeaking at Drumcree church, Democratic
OL,17,FUnionist Party (DUP) MP Carla Lockhart
OL,18,Frepeated calls for PSNI Chief Constable
OL,19,FJon Boutcher and his officers to "do
OL,20,Ftheir job" and facilitate the parade,
OL,21,Fdescribing the current impasse as "mob
OL,22,Frule".
